        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Common (film)\n- People: Jimmy McGovern, David Blair, Michelle Fairley, Nico Mirallegro, Michael Gambon\n- Organizations: BBC One, HBO, USA Network\n- Roles: Catelyn Stark, Dr. Ava Hessington, Margot Al-Harazi\n- Topics: television drama, acting\n\nFacts:\n- Common is a 2014 BBC One 90-minute made-for-television drama.\n- Common was written by Jimmy McGovern and directed by David Blair.\n- Common stars Michelle Fairley, Nico Mirallegro, and Michael Gambon.\n- Michelle Fairley was born in July 1963 and is an actress from Northern Ireland.\n- Michelle Fairley is best known for playing Catelyn Stark in the HBO series Game of Thrones.\n- Michelle Fairley played Dr. Ava Hessington in multiple episodes of the USA Network series Suits.\n- Michelle Fairley also played the terrorist Margot Al-Harazi as a main antagonist in an unnamed production.",
